      "data": {
        "title": "Try it",
        "body": "Use the checklist below when you are unsure whether a graph change is really persisted and whether a reload should keep or discard what you are seeing.\n\n## Trust checklist\n\n1. What address am I on right now?\n2. Is this graph local, provisional, or GitHub-backed?\n3. Did I save before I refreshed?\n4. If I reopen this graph, what source of truth should reload?\n5. If something looks wrong, should I refresh, reopen, or navigate back to a known-good graph?\n6. Can I explain why I trust the current state?\n\nIf you cannot answer those questions, slow down before you keep editing.",
        "presentation": {
          "glyph": {
            "kind": "icon",
            "name": "Article"
          },
          "baseLevel": "detail"
        },
        "identity": {
          "graphId": "tutorial-interface-save-refresh-trust"
        },
        "classRef": "tlz://twilite.zone/library/templates/page-template/classes/page-section.node-class.node"
      },
